# ── Agent hook session logs ──
# Written by .claude/hooks/ and .opencode/hooks/ on every tool call. chat.json
# holds the full session transcript, so these must never be committed.
# Override the location with OPENCODE_HOOKS_LOG_DIR.
logs/


